  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technologies and digital innovations leveraged to ensure more inclusive, effective and relevant learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote and support the implementation of policies and tools (such as virtual platforms) for digital learning based on UNESCO principles and guidelines to promote digital inclusion and well-being, as well as inclusive, appropriate and efficient learning. In particular, equip citizens with media and information literacy skills, as the pandemic has increased our dependence on technological infrastructure while widening the digital divide, making it even more essential to integrate the use of digital technologies in the learning process to achieve a more equitable education.</narrative>
  </description>
